# The paths the public J4n repository takes from this one. An allowlist: a new top-level file or folder is private
# until it is named here. `!` lines take paths back out. Globs are fnmatch: `*` also crosses `/`.
.github/*
.gitignore
.gitleaks.toml
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
rust-toolchain.toml
rustfmt.toml
LICENSE-MIT
LICENSE-APACHE
README.md
assets/*
AGENTS.md
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
install.sh
release/*
scripts/*
crates/*
packs/*
fixtures/*
docs/*
# private: development notes, decision and bug logs, pilots, the deny list
!docs/dev/*
!fixtures/read-pilot/*
